<div class="span6 widget-area" role="complementary">
	<!-- Sidebar: footer-2 --><aside id="block-150" class="widget widget-1 odd widget_block clearfix">
<h5 class="wp-block-heading">OUR MISSION</h5>
</aside><!-- Sidebar: footer-2 --><aside id="block-155" class="widget widget-2 even widget_block widget_text clearfix">
<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Empowering our homeless neighbors to achieve income, dignity, housing and community through storytelling, creative expression, and economic opportunity.</p>
</aside><!-- Sidebar: footer-2 --><aside id="block-160" class="widget widget-3 odd widget_block clearfix">
<h5 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size"><strong>OUR VISION</strong></h5>
</aside><!-- Sidebar: footer-2 --><aside id="block-158" class="widget widget-4 even widget_block widget_text clearfix">
<p class="has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Bringing the community together to make homelessness a brief, rare occurrence.</p>
</aside></div>

<div class="span3 widget-area" role="complementary">
